1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,143
Jiwoo is an illustrator in Seoul. Her client is a VTuber abroad.

2
00:00:05,493 --> 00:00:11,921
Requests arrive vague, extra work creeps in for free, and chasing each payment is awkward.

3
00:00:12,271 --> 00:00:15,700
Each of those costs her money or time.

4
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:20,336
CreatorMilestone is an AI back office for artists like her.

5
00:00:20,686 --> 00:00:25,400
The rule is simple: the AI proposes, Jiwoo approves, PayPal executes.

6
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:30,036
This is the PayPal sandbox, so no real money moves.

7
00:00:30,386 --> 00:00:40,671
She pastes the client's message. Every field shows where it came from. The agent lists every term with the exact words it relied on.

8
00:00:41,021 --> 00:00:48,307
Revisions are flagged, because the client only said maybe. Usage rights and the client's email are unknown.

9
00:00:48,657 --> 00:00:53,800
It drafts a reply in English, with a Korean translation for her.

10
00:00:54,150 --> 00:01:02,293
She fills the gaps and accepts. The client accepts on their phone. Now both sides share the same terms.

11
00:01:02,643 --> 00:01:09,929
The agent proposes the deposit invoice. The amount comes from the milestone plan, never from the model.

12
00:01:10,279 --> 00:01:17,993
Jiwoo approves, and the backend creates a PayPal invoice with the agreed terms inside it, then sends it.

13
00:01:18,343 --> 00:01:26,057
The sandbox buyer pays, and PayPal reports the invoice paid. Only then does the app settle the milestone.

14
00:01:26,407 --> 00:01:33,693
To save time here, a shortcut reuses an invoice paid earlier, and the app still asks PayPal.

15
00:01:34,043 --> 00:01:41,329
Then the client asks for more: a second outfit, one more face revision, and maybe merch use.

16
00:01:41,679 --> 00:01:54,107
Scope Guard checks the agreement. The outfit is out of scope. The face edit exceeds the two included revisions. Merch is only a question, so it is not billed.

17
00:01:54,457 --> 00:02:01,743
Extras are priced from Jiwoo's rate card, a hundred dollars total. The AI never sets a price.

18
00:02:02,093 --> 00:02:08,093
Jiwoo approves, and the client approves on their page. That creates scope version two.

19
00:02:08,443 --> 00:02:16,157
The agent proposes a second invoice, one line per extra. Jiwoo approves, and it goes out through PayPal.

20
00:02:16,507 --> 00:02:24,650
Gemini reads and drafts. Rules compute the money. A validator checks every PayPal write, and 466 automated tests pass.

21
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:28,429
Sandbox only, messages are pasted, one seller account.

22
00:02:28,779 --> 00:02:34,779
Every claim here is in the repository, with a log of real sandbox calls.

23
00:02:35,129 --> 00:02:38,986
CreatorMilestone: get paid for the work you agreed to.

